WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.550
- All right, I always wanna
finish up with something

00:00:02.550 --> 00:00:04.770
that might add some extra joy to your day.

00:00:04.770 --> 00:00:06.616
This is "What I'm Liking."

00:00:06.616 --> 00:00:08.700
(upbeat music)

00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:11.550
So today, it's got a little
personal connection as well.

00:00:11.550 --> 00:00:14.040
Earlier this month I was
in Florida for an event

00:00:14.040 --> 00:00:15.600
and I went into this little coffee shop

00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:17.070
just, you know, to get some caffeine.

00:00:17.070 --> 00:00:18.120
And it was really good.

00:00:18.120 --> 00:00:19.800
And I ran into this woman

00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:22.260
and discovered these amazing cookies.

00:00:22.260 --> 00:00:24.360
Even more amazing, the
woman who made them.

00:00:24.360 --> 00:00:26.430
We took a picture together
and we had a good time.

00:00:26.430 --> 00:00:29.130
But she's proof that you can
actually reinvent yourself

00:00:29.130 --> 00:00:29.963
at any time.

00:00:29.963 --> 00:00:31.650
'Cause she started
discussing this new adventure

00:00:31.650 --> 00:00:32.483
that she was on.

00:00:32.483 --> 00:00:34.110
And I like a cookie, y'all.

00:00:34.110 --> 00:00:36.030
So I was like, all right, I'll try one.

00:00:36.030 --> 00:00:37.080
They were really good.

00:00:37.080 --> 00:00:40.800
So we have her on the line
right now watching on WPTV

00:00:40.800 --> 00:00:43.729
from Respect the Cookie,
say hi to Linda, everybody.

00:00:43.729 --> 00:00:45.510
(audience applauds)

00:00:45.510 --> 00:00:46.343
Hi, Linda.

00:00:47.700 --> 00:00:49.860
So it's nice to see you again.

00:00:49.860 --> 00:00:50.970
I loved your cookie.

00:00:50.970 --> 00:00:53.310
I got in the car immediately
after leaving the coffee shop

00:00:53.310 --> 00:00:55.110
and I was like, well
let's try this cookie.

00:00:55.110 --> 00:00:56.490
It was incredible.

00:00:56.490 --> 00:00:58.470
But I think what's cooler
is this cookie company

00:00:58.470 --> 00:01:00.930
is part of a real kind
of change in your life

00:01:00.930 --> 00:01:02.070
right now, right?

00:01:02.070 --> 00:01:04.770
- Oh, absolutely, Kelly.

00:01:04.770 --> 00:01:07.650
I moved from my longtime home

00:01:07.650 --> 00:01:10.473
in Miami Beach, Florida
to West Palm Beach.

00:01:12.060 --> 00:01:12.960
Along the way,

00:01:12.960 --> 00:01:16.110
I've been making this
little cookie recipe of mine

00:01:16.110 --> 00:01:17.430
and perfecting it.

00:01:17.430 --> 00:01:18.990
And it came from my kitchen

00:01:18.990 --> 00:01:21.900
so I call it From Linda's Kitchen.

00:01:21.900 --> 00:01:25.710
And it's been an amazing journey for me.

00:01:25.710 --> 00:01:27.420
- It's such a great cookie.

00:01:27.420 --> 00:01:29.070
So tell us more about the cookies

00:01:29.070 --> 00:01:30.930
and where people can get them.

00:01:30.930 --> 00:01:31.763
- Oh, yes.

00:01:31.763 --> 00:01:33.630
Well, I happened to bump into you

00:01:33.630 --> 00:01:36.990
at that fun little coffee
shop in downtown West Palm,

00:01:36.990 --> 00:01:39.060
which is called Subculture.

00:01:39.060 --> 00:01:41.550
And the owner there invited me

00:01:41.550 --> 00:01:43.410
because he fell in love with my cookies

00:01:43.410 --> 00:01:45.450
and to help me get my start.

00:01:45.450 --> 00:01:49.050
And I'm also on Instagram
@FromLindasKitchen.

00:01:49.050 --> 00:01:52.440
So my hope is to scale and to get bigger.

00:01:52.440 --> 00:01:55.560
So right now, it's just baby steps.

00:01:55.560 --> 00:01:57.780
And those are some of my other concoctions

00:01:57.780 --> 00:01:59.550
that I dreamt up along the way

00:01:59.550 --> 00:02:01.920
because we were going into holiday season

00:02:01.920 --> 00:02:03.690
and Valentine's Day.

00:02:03.690 --> 00:02:06.270
And I just wanted to offer people more.

00:02:06.270 --> 00:02:08.550
I'm a creative person
and I love, you know,

00:02:08.550 --> 00:02:11.100
working with food products and color.

00:02:11.100 --> 00:02:13.770
And there you saw all
those beautiful colors,

00:02:13.770 --> 00:02:14.603
different cookies.

00:02:14.603 --> 00:02:17.550
Right now just concentrating
on the chocolate chip cookie

00:02:17.550 --> 00:02:18.660
because it's so rich.

00:02:18.660 --> 00:02:20.130
And I double roll it.

00:02:20.130 --> 00:02:22.080
That's why you get that burst of chocolate

00:02:22.080 --> 00:02:23.040
in your mouth.
- Oh, my gosh.

00:02:23.040 --> 00:02:24.390
- And it's an explosion.

00:02:24.390 --> 00:02:26.490
And I'm so glad you liked it, Kelly.

00:02:26.490 --> 00:02:27.450
- I loved it.

00:02:27.450 --> 00:02:29.400
I wanted my friend that was with me-

00:02:29.400 --> 00:02:30.233
And you gave her one.

00:02:30.233 --> 00:02:32.730
I wanted her to not like
it and give it to me.

00:02:32.730 --> 00:02:35.850
And unfortunately she
ended up liking it as well.

00:02:35.850 --> 00:02:38.460
So just got the one. (laughs)

00:02:38.460 --> 00:02:39.960
But it was so good.

00:02:39.960 --> 00:02:40.793
But thank you, Linda.

00:02:40.793 --> 00:02:43.038
I'm liking your post right now, all right.

00:02:43.038 --> 00:02:43.871
(audience applauds)

00:02:43.871 --> 00:02:45.870
- [Linda] Thank you, thank you so much.

00:02:45.870 --> 00:02:47.460
- Absolutely, Linda, but that's not all.

00:02:47.460 --> 00:02:48.990
Our season-long partner Pilot pen,

00:02:48.990 --> 00:02:51.420
makers of G2, the go-to pin
of the Kelly Clarkson Show,

00:02:51.420 --> 00:02:54.570
want to honor truly unstoppable
people just like you, ma'am.

00:02:54.570 --> 00:02:55.403
So they're gonna be writing you a check

00:02:55.403 --> 00:02:56.730
for $1,000.

00:02:56.730 --> 00:02:57.603
How's that sound?

00:02:57.603 --> 00:02:58.970
(audience applauds)

00:02:58.970 --> 00:03:00.820
- Oh my gosh, that's insane.

00:03:00.820 --> 00:03:02.070
Thank you so much.

00:03:02.070 --> 00:03:03.275
That's incredible.
- Absolutely.

00:03:03.275 --> 00:03:04.108
- [Linda] Thank you.

00:03:04.108 --> 00:03:06.210
- It was lovely seeing you again, Linda.

00:03:06.210 --> 00:03:07.304
All the best.

00:03:07.304 --> 00:03:08.815
Thank you to all our guests this hour,

00:03:08.815 --> 00:03:10.527
Christina Ricci, Melissa Rauch,

00:03:10.527 --> 00:03:13.530
the men of Channing
Tatum's "Magic Mike Live."

00:03:13.530 --> 00:03:14.530
That was incredible.

00:03:16.050 --> 00:03:18.810
Y'all have a great day and
if not, try and change it.

